# Line-ending policy.
#
# Rust embeds these files byte-for-byte via `include_str!`, and
# `default_prompt_snapshot_identity_matches_python` sha256-hashes one of them.
# A CRLF checkout (Windows default without this file) silently changes those
# bytes and breaks golden hashes on CI while passing locally. Force LF.
forza-rust/assets/*.txt text eol=lf
forza-rust/assets/*.json text eol=lf
forza-rust/fixtures/**/*.json text eol=lf
